 r←Test_DirSelect_007(stopFlag batchFlag);myGuiParms;parms;n;⎕TRAP;rc
⍝ Exercise "DirSelect" with a parent.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 myGuiParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 myGuiParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'
 myGuiParms.testMode←1

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.DirSelect.CreateParms
 parms.addToCaption←'My request'
 parms.posn←45 35
 parms.fixDefaultDrive←0
 parms.info←'We need a directory for the installation of the software:'
 parms.allowCreate←1
 parms.allowRemove←1
 parms.defaultDrive←#.FilesAndDirs.GetTempPath
 parms.parent←⍎'F'⎕WC'Form'

 n←myGuiParms parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.DirSelect.Create''
 ⎕DL 0.1
 ⎕NQ'F' 'Close'

 r←∆OK
